        "en": [
          "The northern freight yard was a [[jungle|jungle]] of tracks, but its canteen displayed photographs of meals delivered during last year's [[epidemic|epidemic]]. Officer He's [[summary|summary]] confirmed the removal team had rented space here. A posted [[regulation|regulation]] barred outsiders from loading areas, so we would [[focus|focus]] on the drivers' serving window. Somebody dismissed last night's driver as [[drunk|drunk]]. He silently turned a [[tariff|tariff]] sheet over and pointed at a red arrow toward the [[highway|highway]]. Blue powder beneath his nails meant more than other people's judgment. I bought noodles and waited for him to speak.",
          "Beside a vegetable [[tub|tub]], the cook recognized the dispatch number. A [[surgeon|surgeon]] had borrowed her telephone and said his station was [[dependent|dependent]] on the fund. She requested [[understanding|understanding]], unwilling to cost someone meals through curiosity. Cheng agreed not to record her face and sought verifiable [[intelligence|intelligence]]. The cook took a duplicate from a drawer containing her child's plastic [[pistol|pistol]]. The cargo had attracted a night-transport [[premium|premium]], yet its route formed a [[loop|loop]] beginning and ending at the port. Her child sometimes folded identical slips into planes while waiting for her shift to end. This one had survived.",
          "A medical [[bulletin|bulletin]] warned against dismissing a dizziness [[syndrome|syndrome]] as drunkenness. The cargo [[selection|selection]] field carried the fund's seal and a note about [[economy|economy]]. A train [[lover|lover]] had left old photographs. In them the warehouse still appeared to [[possess|possess]] a third side door, absent from current plans. The [[monetary|monetary]] payment was split in two, one part labeled [[railroad|railroad]] transfer. Cheng left the duplicate there, photographing it flat together with its drawer. We needed a door, not an invented story about one driver.",
          "Cheng played last night's engine recording. Its [[spectrum|spectrum]] showed recurring friction. The [[robust|robust]] driver, Shao, gave [[consent|consent]] for us to examine his vehicle [[lease|lease]]. His [[concern|concern]] was an accusation of private carriage. He said a [[neutral|neutral]] intermediary issued the map and a retired [[banker|banker]] handled payments. Asked from which [[aspect|aspect]] he had seen the side door, he pointed to the window beside the canteen [[hearth|hearth]]. Lights had appeared there at midnight. A reversing truck's rear lamps had not reached the workshop wall, suggesting space behind it.",
          "Shao had [[chronic|chronic]] back pain but refused to [[rebel|rebel]] against assignments. His [[saving|savings]] were for his daughter's schooling. Pointing to temperatures in the sheet's [[center|center]], he said he could not convert [[fahrenheit|Fahrenheit]] readings, so had not filled blanks. The cook weighted the duplicate with a [[coin|coin]]. We walked the [[stretch|stretch]] outside the side door and heard an electric [[heater|heater]] running intermittently. An [[actor|actor]] was rehearsing in the front hall, beneath He Qing's name as [[sponsor|sponsor]]. The stage lights and hidden overnight carriage were separated by one narrow lane.",
          "The cook discussed no [[politics|politics]], finishing the [[cabbage|cabbage]] instead. A driver received a [[circular|circular]] declaring the side door a temporary store for donated [[jewellery|jewellery]]. On its gentle [[incline|incline]], Chen found deep new double-wheel marks; light ornaments would not leave those. Inside, the host began to [[herald|herald]] a new aid season. Cheng did not mock the [[affective|affective]] expressions of thanks. She asked Shao to mark the exact location. We sent the photographs to He and arranged to return at dawn. The vehicle's next destination, he told us, was a printing works rather than a hospital."
        ]
