          "The yard stood a hundred [[metre|metres]] from the river. Retired worker Wen would [[reconcile|reconcile]] our maps, giving Chen a [[pat|pat]] before pointing toward the [[shore|shore]]. A [[rooster|rooster]] gave me a [[headache|headache]]. It [[might|might]] be more dependable than a bell, Wen joked. A neighbor grew [[hysterical|hysterical]] about creatures underground. Rejecting this [[fantasy|fantasy]], Wen also barred a [[shortcut|shortcut]] through the house: rain-softened ground beside the shaft could collapse. He preferred a longer walk and accurate memory to another injury.",
          "His wife removed a [[rose|rose]] from the drawing. In a [[hoarse|hoarse]] voice she recalled pump [[mischief|mischief]]. This home's [[mistress|mistress]] made a firm meal [[invitation|invitation]]. A [[rough|rough]] pipe to the [[sink|sink]] could [[hurt|hurt]] her wrist. Do not turn shafts into a [[monstrous|monstrous]] legend, she said: [[gracious|gracious]] Wen still came home to wash dishes. Helping serve, Cheng reminded us that records involved dishes and families awaiting workers, not merely exciting danger.",
          "The [[enormous|enormous]] table had a [[soft|soft]] cover. After tasting soup, Wen added [[salt|salt]]. Calling residents' fears [[hysteria|hysteria]] came easily to people who never entered wet shafts. With a [[mop|mop]] he indicated [[exotic|exotic]] trees: taking surface [[moisture|moisture]] did not ensure underground safety. Original [[soil|soil]] tests contained [[sand|sand]] samples, while workers reported dizzy [[illness|illness]]. I asked him to distinguish people, times and positions rather than assign one cause immediately. Those distinctions had once been dismissed as troublesome.",
          "Population [[multiplication|multiplication]] prolonged temporary supply. At their [[fellowship|fellowship]] celebration workers raised a [[toast|toast]], uniforms wet with [[sweat|sweat]], a [[scarlet|scarlet]] flag concealing a valve. Wen urged [[immediate|immediate]] checks. I named no [[murderer|murderer]], but the [[feast|feast]] showed [[external|external]] completion claims preceded reality. A [[tank|tank]] number appeared in one corner. Enlargement revealed a missing bolt, matching a hole in the orchard pump. Chen would not dismiss that correspondence.",
          "Attempts to [[seminate|seminate]] distrust blamed [[immigration|immigration]] and outsiders. Wen's [[narration|narration]] named fund dispatch as ordering early supply; arguments would [[distract|distract]] us. Putting gossip [[aside|aside]], he closed the [[tap|tap]] and refused a [[sermon|sermon]]. No worker was [[immortal|immortal]]; every [[nation|nation]] produced people who could fall. Cheng retained the pauses carrying his [[sentiment|sentiment]] and promised a copy for his family whenever he wished them to hear what he had feared.",
          "The photograph's reverse mapped an entrance through the mechanical yard, not the riverbank. Wen admitted yielding on the last shutdown for fear of lost jobs. I did not comfort that admission away. He would guide equipped inspectors to the doorway tomorrow. Chen kept a copy, leaving the original. Wen's wife packed Cheng toast and requested help with her kitchen pipe when we returned. Engineering connected to that kitchen as well as grand plans. We followed the path to find a safe approach first."
