          "[[abundant|Abundant]] flow did not change the sampling [[pace|pace]]. [[probable|Probable]] rain in the [[forecast|forecast]] urged equipment withdrawal. Under supervision Ye would [[uncover|uncover]] numbers beneath paint, not scrape residue. We would [[pack|pack]] and [[input|input]] records. A [[cue|cue]] marked completed separate samples. Beneath the new paint lay a B-17 return plate renamed U3 clean works. Every object was not necessarily defective; a reassuring identity concealed an entire batch's origins.",
