          "A truck's [[tyre|tyre]] was flat; its driver struggled to [[cope|cope]] with extra returns. The [[overseas|overseas]] packaging tended to [[impress|impress]] people, he said, although a box could [[leak|leak]]. Chen warned him not to [[lean|lean]] against damaged containers and asked him to [[recall|recall]] his last load. He first checked whether the manager was coming. Crossing a drain, I nearly made my [[leap|leap]] too long; Chen caught me and joked about investigating without becoming cargo. The driver smiled, then admitted that last night's returns had headed toward coastal marshalling grounds rather than a disposal centre.",
          "The neighbouring [[barber|barber]] had not opened, but his camera had recorded the truck. He supplied a [[precise|precise]] time. I documented preservation of the [[precious|precious]] footage separately from the driver's [[observation|observation]]. His hand began to [[tremble|tremble]] as he signed: he knew only a [[fraction|fraction]] of the route. The manager arrived at the [[site|site]] and pointed toward a [[massive|massive]] shelter. We remained outside with the witnesses instead of entering his private office. Chen showed him the sack's underside and demanded an explanation for new seals on clinic returns.",
