          "Du discovered that a return sheet used [[ounce|ounce]] measurements, unlike the truck's scales. A torn bag began to [[emit|emit]] an odour. Chen did not [[intend|intend]] to open it and summoned qualified staff. His [[abrupt|abrupt]] decision cleared a passage across the [[spacious|spacious]] shelter. The manager expressed [[disapproval|disapproval]], fearing closure. Drivers made a [[spontaneous|spontaneous]] move to the [[cafeteria|cafeteria]] with their lunches, leaving [[virgin|virgin]] outer packaging for examination. We photographed labels without breaking seals. Their withdrawal also won patients a little time in which their concerns could no longer simply be ignored.",
