        "en": [
          "At the gate Du began to [[denounce|denounce]] his own deletion of a clinical note. He stood on the [[verge|verge]] of losing his voice. I offered [[pastry|pastry]]; he passed it to a waiting [[messenger|messenger]]. [[irrespective|Irrespective]] of who supplied money, a clinic was an [[entity|entity]] serving patients and could not follow the fund's [[tempo|tempo]]. The care worker's [[descendant|descendant]] came to collect her, but she asked him to wait. She could [[foresee|foresee]] names becoming mere statistics again tomorrow. The cabinet was upstairs now, each paper register heavier than yesterday.",
          "The register included [[kidney|kidney]] examination results. Du stressed these described only part of the injury and offered no independent diagnosis. A [[gleam|gleam]] crossed his glasses. The manager tried to [[sneak|sneak]] away; He recalled him to check signatures. Withdrawal would make aid [[void|void]], the manager argued, offering his status as a [[patriot|patriot]] as assurance. I asked him to [[quantify|quantify]] the claimed total recall. He had no figures. Instead he tried to [[tempt|tempt]] Du with continued beds in exchange for silence. Knocking a [[paperback|paperback]] down, he watched Du retrieve it and lay the altered page flat. Both beds and records must continue, Du said.",
          "Vendors continued to [[hawk|hawk]] breakfast as officers arranged [[forthcoming|forthcoming]] sampling. The greatest [[complication|complication]] was that useful and dangerous goods had shared a vehicle. I would not [[despise|despise]] people surviving on donations. Nor should the station [[levy|levy]] return-storage fees that encouraged people to [[indulge|indulge]] their silence. The manager tried to [[intimidate|intimidate]] drivers with closure, growing [[vulgar|vulgar]]. Chen stood before one driver: another gamble could not conceal a [[catastrophe|catastrophe]]. The man handed over the vehicle log. Its cleaning entry contained only a false tick.",
          "Matching numbers were no [[coincidence|coincidence]]. Vehicles carrying returned equipment might [[contaminate|contaminate]] later cargo. Preventing mixed loads was Du's [[foremost|foremost]] concern; he did not claim a single proven cause. Three [[consecutive|consecutive]] transfer dates required a further [[probe|probe]]. Animal nutrient [[assimilation|assimilation]] results offered by the manager, although [[quantitative|quantitative]], were not clinical records. A symptom [[cluster|cluster]] must not make everyone the [[prey|prey]] of speculation. Inspectors received the [[apparatus|apparatus]] and sealed samples. I photographed each transfer so careful paperwork did not accompany careless handling.",
          "A [[tug|tug]] in the plan supposedly supplied an observation [[expedition|expedition]]. Chen asked staff to [[rectify|rectify]] its purpose entry. I would [[refrain|refrain]] from telling Mother of an unfinished victory. The coastal yard bordered a [[marsh|marsh]]. The children's soothing [[ballet|ballet]] music came from a fund-sponsored performance: real help had opened a door through which risky cargo passed too. Du's [[courtesy|courtesy]] toward inspectors did not soften his insistence. They could not wait for symptoms to [[deteriorate|deteriorate]] before investigating a [[pollutant|pollutant]]. We awaited sealed-sample findings, offered no chemical guesses at the depot, and suggested no additional medicines.",
          "Seated in a [[bamboo|bamboo]] chair, the worker wondered whether a blank column would [[induce|induce]] blame against her. The [[abnormal|abnormal]] action was deleting the form, Du answered, not any failure to be [[diligent|diligent]]. Patients still [[reside|reside]] in three villages; we would notify them of continuing support. He documented the deletion before witnesses and handed He the original, keeping an authorized working copy. He signed slowly, seeking no applause. Cheng repeated his last sentence: 'I feared losing aid, but never asked what it contained.' Tomorrow we would go to the ferry yard and trace the White Tower column to its other end."
        ]
