          "The station's [[imaginative|imaginative]] tour used a [[penguin|penguin]] model and called White Tower an aid [[masterpiece|masterpiece]]. Its [[tolerant|tolerant]] guide nevertheless offered to [[dispatch|dispatch]] us to a hotel: island [[interpersonal|interpersonal]] ties were close; its director was [[exemplary|exemplary]]. I asked about a [[layoff|layoff]] list. A [[wretched|wretched]] maintenance worker considered claims that nobody remembered old goods [[absurd|absurd]]. He had returned for personal tools, but guards still prevented him going upstairs.",
          "His [[modesty|modesty]] concealed neither knowledge nor ambition for the tower's [[glamor|glamor]]. In our [[midst|midst]] he identified a painted-over [[trait|trait]] on the doorway. Within the safety [[radius|radius]], old boxes had stood outside, labels undergoing [[disintegration|disintegration]]. The [[dolphin|dolphin]] programme came later; [[thereafter|thereafter]] everything became ecological aid. This was no riskless [[paradise|paradise]]. Chen examined a replaced [[hinge|hinge]] and inward bolt. We still registered properly rather than treating an old door as permission to enter.",
