          "A [[cholesterol|cholesterol]] health poster made reassurance seem merely [[symbolic|symbolic]]. An observation [[module|module]] box bore matching lunch-container marks. Wind began to [[howl|howl]]; forms scattered from a [[booth|booth]]. Rain entering the store could be [[disastrous|disastrous]]. The curator suspended label [[processing|processing]]. In a [[sober|sober]] voice Cheng directed people uphill as [[infectious|infectious]] anxiety spread. A manager tried to [[expel|expel]] us. An island officer contacted by He confirmed permission and kept the door open, allowing papers to be read without pursuit.",
          "The director stressed equipment [[superiority|superiority]] and different maintenance at this [[latitude|latitude]]. Passing a [[cute|cute]] bird display, the curator opened a cabinet behind a [[partition|partition]]. This [[nominal|nominal]] exhibition store contained blue-line labels. She called preservation no [[rebellion|rebellion]]: she would not let rain [[swamp|swamp]] old paper. Willing to [[dedicate|dedicate]] time to the inquiry, she showed a delivery route from the mainland [[peninsula|peninsula]]. L074-6's reverse named White Tower's sample room. Someone else had withdrawn the original table. She recorded his staff number without guessing his motives.",
