          "Rain had once [[saturate|saturated]] the bag. Today's [[climax|climax]] was a [[rectangular|rectangular]] receipt. Curtains would [[flap|flap]] while the worker offered his work [[token|token]] to identify the cabinet. Workers and inspectors could [[mingle|mingle]] beyond the role of [[spectator|spectator]]. Kitchens separated [[edible|edible]] supplies from containers [[prone|prone]] to leaking. Nobody applauded the director's [[exposition|exposition]]. Each safety [[norm|norm]] had names; [[impetus|impetus]] came from people identifying actual boxes handled, not from forbidding doubt about aid. Chen gradually stopped frowning at the worker's badge.",
          "Memorial [[verse|verse]] promised prosperity; health posters discussed only [[obesity|obesity]]. [[tan|Tan]] arms carried goods while office [[prestige|prestige]] grew. The electrician connected [[insulation|insulation]] checks to old tables. A horn might [[startle|startle]] children; volunteers closed the [[interim|interim]] waiting-room door and would [[reaffirm|reaffirm]] sailing arrangements. Signature refusal brought no [[repression|repression]] or forced [[exile|exile]]. The anonymous volunteer chose to stay with the curator. Cheng offered a recording; she requested only their shared working conversation, preserving control of her own story.",
          "A [[gigantic|gigantic]] crane would [[hoist|hoist]] the document case. Chen preferred hand carrying. A [[quart|quart]] measuring flask was experimental equipment, not drinking water. Staff selected [[eligible|eligible]] carriers; his [[feeble|feeble]] legs required rest. He would [[abide|abide]] by arrangements and [[absolutely|absolutely]] accepted slower movement. Crane [[acceleration|acceleration]] altered load posture; carrying was [[acceptable|acceptable]]. Officers counted an [[accessary|accessary]] clasp and every lock number. Chen handed over his route drawing and put hands into pockets, no longer pretending another urgent task excused his inability to lift.",
          "The [[accomplishment|accomplishment]] was not a heroic photograph. We must [[accustom|accustom]] ourselves to others taking over. A hired [[actress|actress]] cancelled filming: [[actually|actually]] she knew no cargo route. The [[ad|ad]] called everything new, its brightest [[adjective|adjective]]. Shown photographs, she refused that line. An [[adjustable|adjustable]] lamp illuminated receipts. My [[admiration|admiration]] for the curator came from her precise limits. Public lists and clinical details were sealed separately. Nobody used other people's names as ornaments proving personal goodness.",
          "Even with easing wind, the ferry needed inspection. We stayed for head counts. Officers took originals through the official passage; we boarded with authorized images and belongings. Du reported a new supply truck's arrival. The worker stayed to claim compensation with repair records. At the doorway the curator raised empty hands: custody had truly passed on. Cheng rested her injured hand; Chen closed his eyes. Holding a ticket over dark water, I finally understood safe return as work requiring patience too."
