          "New suffixes would [[augment|augment]] totals; a scientist's [[autobiography|autobiography]] recorded no equipment growth. Software could [[automate|automate]] catalogues and [[automatically|automatically]] rename items. [[automation|Automation]] did not erase authorization. Still [[awake|awake]] and [[awfully|awfully]] tired, Chen recognized L074-6's missing corner board. Mainland staff confirmed rail transfer to an inland station instead of the museum. He requested preservation of identified boxes, not a blanket blockade. Zhao retained original comparisons so warnings concerned real objects rather than spreading fear across all shipments.",
