          "Workers checked vehicles in an [[outdoor|outdoor]] yard [[outdoors|outdoors]]. River wind on the [[outskirt|outskirt]] blew [[outwards|outwards]]. An [[overdue|overdue]] permit failed, and the platform [[overhang|overhang]] could not bear [[overload|overload]]. Both final boxes were retained, completing known batch custody. Yet office orders would remove old reserve containers from the platform, claiming absence from our suffix sheet. Chen requested load checks: no number match meant no automatic permission. He arranged inventory of every object under the same transfer order, so the final gap no longer depended solely on our label recognition.",
