        "recap": "阿芬已救回岸，梁师傅与小唐仍困；工程原页在受牵动高架，现场按先人后物施救，贺青留岸配合调查。",
        "cn": [
          "避险点[[fridge|冰箱]]照着人脸，阿芬醒来还很[[shy|怯生生]]。医护先接她，救援组继续[[sift|详查]]梁师傅的路线。我的[[sight|视线]]不能离开灯，指挥员用[[sign|手势]]说退后。想一次接完会很[[silly|糊涂]]，不同固定点不能[[simultaneously|同时]]承受增加重量。慈善[[singer|歌手]]的宣传已停，[[siren|警报器]]只有明确撤离信号。母亲在铺子[[sitting-room|起居室]]等着，我们不会让[[sixty|六十]]秒焦急变成自己闯进水里的理由。程雾检查剩下的灯，告诉负责人哪一台会很快没电，让真正的准备有具体数字。",
          "湿板像[[skate|滑冰]]面，修船[[skill|技能]]不能保老陈[[skin|皮肤]]不伤。远处[[skyscraper|高楼]]广告说城市新生，经理的[[slang|俚语]]却把工人叫成[[slave|奴隶]]。梁师傅不再答他，声音[[sleepy|困乏的]]，仍会[[slightly|轻轻地]]移动手指示位。岸侧掉了只[[slipper|拖鞋]]，护板[[slit|裂口]]缓缓[[slowly|慢慢地]]扩大。贺青那种[[sly|狡黠的]]改名本领不能堵住它。设备再[[smart|聪明]]，[[smog|烟雾]]散尽之后也只能报它实际测得的值，错误输入不会因为屏幕光亮就变真。负责人改用直接观察，继续接人。",
          "临时通道无法[[smoothly|顺畅地]]通行，不能嫌步骤像[[snail|蜗牛]]一样慢。缆线如[[snake|蛇]]弯着，没人[[sneer|冷笑]]等候。海风使我[[sneeze|打喷嚏]]，我们不把伤人叫作勇敢，也不做评点工人的[[snob|势利人]]。基金[[snobbish|自命不凡的]]经理终于闭嘴，避险棚里的睡人[[snore|打鼾]]，一块[[soap|肥皂]]留在洗手台。阿芬开始[[sob|啜泣]]，她问孩子的[[soccer|足球]]课怎么办，社区[[society|团体]]答应接他。生活里的问题仍有地方被回答，不能因为救援很紧急，就把一个母亲只剩的身份写成被救者。",
          "老陈的[[sock|短袜]]湿透，封存柜中的[[sodium|钠]]展签不影响目前称重，他只指固定点。母亲的[[sofa|沙发]]本该让他休息，现场声音却没[[soften|缓和]]。程雾[[softly|温柔地]]叫他退开，这种[[softness|温和]]不是动摇。风险并非[[solely|仅仅]]来自潮，既有偏载要先[[solidify|固定]]。他说[[sometime|改天]]回铺子再修腕上的旧疼。我没让一个[[sophisticate|老于世故的人]]替身体逞强，告诉救援员他腕不好，改由别人接绳。他点头转身时，一块受牵动的栏板从高侧扫来，正击在他举起挡人的右腕。",
          "他倒在划线后的岸面，没有落水。医护立即接手，右腕不能使力，疼得说不出玩笑。我蹲下问他能否听见，他点头，却让人先看平台。负责人已经接到替换人员，不会因他受伤停救。岸对[[southeast|东南]]方向有灯回应，小唐指梁师傅已离开蛇形管；救援通道转向[[southwards|南方]]，沿[[southwest|西南]]固定点带回。梁师傅终于踏上岸，抓着扶栏迟迟不松，程雾重复他名字，他才抬头。我们把人交给医护，不让他立刻替取纸冒第二次险。",
          "小唐还在高点，记录箱在他外侧，原通道不能再用。何警官安排岸上两路同步准备，一组接人，一组等安全条件允许后取箱，不用一个人两只手完成所有任务。老陈被送往医疗点，我跟车到门口，程雾留现场帮辨小唐呼叫。医生说要进一步检查，我不替他的腕骨猜结论。此时父亲的旧磁带不在我手里，但我想起里面那句‘还没回来’。我给母亲发老陈已有人照顾，再返回划线边。下一章接回小唐，不能让一句确认到了岸只写给纸，不写给仍在等的人。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "A shelter [[fridge|fridge]] lit faces. Awake but [[shy|shy]], A-Fen received care. Teams would [[sift|sift]] Liang's route. My [[sight|sight]] stayed on lamps as a [[sign|sign]] directed retreat. One hurried return was [[silly|silly]]: fixing points could not bear added loads [[simultaneously|simultaneously]]. A charity [[singer|singer]] fell silent; a [[siren|siren]] carried real evacuation. Mother waited in the [[sitting-room|sitting-room]]. [[sixty|Sixty]] anxious seconds authorized no plunge. Cheng identified lamps nearing battery exhaustion, giving preparation concrete figures instead of a general promise that enough equipment remained.",
          "Wet boards resembled [[skate|skate]] surfaces. Repair [[skill|skill]] protected no [[skin|skin]] automatically. A [[skyscraper|skyscraper]] promoted renewal while management [[slang|slang]] called workers [[slave|slaves]]. [[sleepy|Sleepy]] Liang could [[slightly|slightly]] shift fingers to identify position. A [[slipper|slipper]] fell; a [[slit|slit]] widened [[slowly|slowly]]. [[sly|Sly]] renaming could not close it. A [[smart|smart]] display showed only measured input; clear air after [[smog|smog]] did not correct false values. Rescuers used direct observations. Chen listened rather than claiming that years of repairing boats made him able to override present measurements.",
          "Passage could not work [[smoothly|smoothly]]; steps resembling a [[snail|snail]] were still needed. [[snake|Snake]]-like cables made nobody [[sneer|sneer]] at waiting. I would [[sneeze|sneeze]] in sea wind. We were no [[snob|snob]] judging workers; [[snobbish|snobbish]] management finally stopped. Shelter sleepers could [[snore|snore]] beside washroom [[soap|soap]]. A-Fen began to [[sob|sob]] about her child's [[soccer|soccer]] class. A community [[society|society]] arranged collection. Urgency must not erase her everyday identity, leaving her merely a rescued body within our story.",
          "Chen's [[sock|sock]] was soaked. A [[sodium|sodium]] exhibit label changed no load; he indicated structure. He needed a [[sofa|sofa]], but sounds would not [[soften|soften]]. Cheng spoke [[softly|softly]]; [[softness|softness]] was no wavering. Tide was not [[solely|solely]] responsible. Staff needed to [[solidify|solidify]] existing loads. Chen proposed rest [[sometime|sometime]]. No [[sophisticate|sophisticate]] could outargue an injured body. I requested another line handler. Turning in agreement, he raised his arm against a swinging rail panel. It struck his right wrist. He fell on the shore side of the marked line, not into water.",
          "Medical staff took over; he could not use the wrist or joke through pain. He nodded at my voice but pointed toward the platform. Replacements kept rescue moving. A [[southeast|southeast]] lamp answered; Tang confirmed Liang clear of the pipe. Staff guided him [[southwards|southwards]] through a [[southwest|southwest]] fixing route. He reached shore and held rails until Cheng repeated his name. Medical staff received him; nobody demanded another dangerous trip to retrieve paper. His own safe arrival was enough work for him tonight.",
          "Tang remained high, the box outside him. He assigned separate person and document teams rather than requiring two hands to do everything. I accompanied Chen to the medical doorway, then returned while Cheng relayed calls. Further examinations were needed; I guessed no bone injury. I remembered Father's recorded warning that his vessel was not back. Mother learned Chen had care. Next Tang must return. A confirmation of arrival could not be written only for papers while someone still waited for it."
        ]
