          "Decisions on [[criminal|criminal]] responsibility followed particular actions. Defendants could [[deny|deny]] allegations; a [[prosecutor|prosecutor]] needed checkable material. This let words and paper carry their own weight rather than enact personal generosity. [[justice|Justice]] did not heal Chen's wrist. Compensation, care and a paid apprentice allowed continued opening. Resting his right hand, he taught two-handed lifting and warned against always accusing others of slowness. We laughed without engraving a slogan. Waiting for completion cost more time than prewriting arrival but brought people home to meals.",
          "[[publication|Publication]] explained the new chain while the museum's previously [[correct|corrected]] account preserved Father's [[reputation|reputation]]. Ye would [[acknowledge|acknowledge]] early signatures and omitted follow-up, completing responsibility arrangements. Genuine help excused no untreated cargo. To [[compensate|compensate]] meant checked payments, not an [[apology|apology]] alone. I did not end the years through [[revenge|revenge]]. [[peace|Peace]] came through Mother's weekend plans, Cheng's ordinary recordings and Chen accepting lifting help. All six children had support and different paths, never one perfect total. Our work had been handed over; their lives could proceed under their own direction.",
          "We would [[preserve|preserve]] the old tape and lantern [[tradition|tradition]]. The [[community|community]] stopped frightening children with ghosts. Port [[renovation|renovation]] made real load and water lines visible. There was no detective [[reward|reward]], yet I learned to [[cherish|cherish]] returned receipts and complete refusals. Such small [[dignity|dignity]] let people be heard without borrowed fame. At a [[reunion|reunion]] supper we played one tape side from beginning to end: engines and an iron cup against the boat. Mother requested no rewind. Cheng wrote no fresh clue. Chen told an ordinary repair story until the soup cooled.",
